@Okane.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5091

### Register a new user
POST {{Okane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "SuperSecret123"
}

### Register - invalid input (422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST {{Okane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "short"
}

### Register - duplicate email (422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST {{Okane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "SuperSecret123"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{Okane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "SuperSecret123"
}

### Login - invalid credentials (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{Okane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### Get current user (uses the access token returned by the Login request above)
GET {{Okane.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
